    {
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "event": "Email outage resolved. Cause was Railway disabling outbound SMTP on Hobby, not a credential fault: production logged [Errno 101] Network is unreachable on every send since 2026-07-16 (card D6, spec 2026-08-24 section 15.4, n=103 over 21 days). Fixed by upgrading to Pro AND redeploying; the upgrade alone does not affect an already-running container. Verified by triggering a brief that reached the inbox. Shipped in 590bc9f (on origin/main, deployed): outbox.last_error with an additive migration, an HTTPS Resend transport behind EMAIL_TRANSPORT=auto, and per-account recipients via resolve_recipient. Partially satisfies SA-006; SA-006 is NOT accepted as done. Known gap: resolve_recipient falls back to DELIVERY_EMAIL_TO on a transient users.db lookup failure, which could misroute a beta user's brief to the owner. Tests 2832 passed, 5 skipped. The 2026-09-19 audit's findings 1 and 3 are superseded and carry a correction banner. User then resequenced onto PI Prospect (IPO intelligence); next task is IPO-0a in docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-21-ipo-prospect-p3-substance.md, outside this PI. DOC-001 remains review_required and all SA stories remain todo."
